  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674546",
      "title": "Setting Page Metadata",
      "lectureOrder": 32,
      "videoOrder": 28,
      "sourceHash": "7f8779cbe8e78c18e5bc0e48d93f67bd98398fc626b4b32b4bf8dad8cb27c63c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.7,
          "en": "After all these crucial core features,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.7,
          "end": 7.95,
          "en": "finally, to conclude this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.95,
          "end": 8.783,
          "en": "and to come to an end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.783,
          "end": 11.07,
          "en": "there's one last essential feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.38,
          "en": "you also should know about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.38,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "And that would be metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 18.81,
          "en": "and how you can add metadata to your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "But to be clear, what exactly do I mean by metadata?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "Well, I for example, mean that title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "which shows up here in the tab bar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.81,
          "en": "or which also shows up in Google search results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.81,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "And I also mean this description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 33.75,
          "en": "which shows up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.75,
          "end": 35.16,
          "en": "and a bunch of other metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.16,
          "end": 37.623,
          "en": "you might wanna add to your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 41.22,
          "en": "Adding such metadata to pages with Remix",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.22,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "is again, quite straightforward and simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 47.85,
          "en": "All you have to do, for example, here in notes.jsx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.85,
          "end": 51,
          "en": "is export another new function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51,
          "end": 52.56,
          "en": "And by the way, it does not matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.56,
          "end": 55.53,
          "en": "where in this file you export the function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.53,
          "end": 58.23,
          "en": "the order does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.23,
          "end": 60.42,
          "en": "So here, maybe after the links function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.42,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "I'll export another function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 63.75,
          "en": "which is called meta.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 66.18,
          "en": "And you might have seen this function before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.18,
          "end": 67.83,
          "en": "in that root.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 70.803,
          "en": "there actually also is such a meta function already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 73.59,
          "en": "Now meta is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 73.59,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "that should return a JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 81,
          "en": "And on this object you can set various metadata fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81,
          "end": 81.9,
          "en": "Now you'll learn a bit more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 81.9,
          "end": 84.03,
          "en": "about the available fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 84.03,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "and how meta works in the official documentation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "but you can, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 90.06,
          "en": "add the title field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 90.06,
          "end": 91.86,
          "en": "to set the title for a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 91.86,
          "end": 93.81,
          "en": "The title that will show up as a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 93.81,
          "end": 95.07,
          "en": "in your search results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.07,
          "end": 98.10300000000001,
          "en": "and also in the tab bar title, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.94,
          "end": 100.17,
          "en": "And here, that could, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.17,
          "end": 102.813,
          "en": "be all notes, for this notes page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 103.837,
          "end": 106.89,
          "en": "We can also add a description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 106.89,
          "end": 110.4,
          "en": "and that could be manage your notes with ease,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 110.4,
          "end": 111.513,
          "en": "anything like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 112.59,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "Now the metadata you set up on a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 118.95,
          "en": "will be merged with any higher level page metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 118.95,
          "end": 120.78,
          "en": "you might have to find.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 120.78,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "For example, in the root page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 124.14,
          "en": "we also have a meta function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 124.14,
          "end": 126.06,
          "en": "and the data defined here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 126.06,
          "end": 129.42,
          "en": "the metadata defined here would be merged with metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.42,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "defined in one of the other pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 134.49,
          "en": "since they are wrapped by the root page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 134.49,
          "end": 135.783,
          "en": "as you learned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 139.26,
          "en": "If we have clashes like this title here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 139.26,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "which is defined both in the metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 144.24,
          "en": "of notes.jsx and root.jsx,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 144.24,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "the lower level page wins,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 150.18,
          "en": "so the more specific metadata definition wins.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 150.18,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "The metadata definition of this page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 152.43,
          "end": 155.28300000000002,
          "en": "wins over the generic root metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 159.3,
          "en": "And that is how you can add your metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 159.3,
          "end": 161.013,
          "en": "If you again, save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 162.155,
          "end": 165.45,
          "en": "you will notice that for this all notes page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 165.45,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "the title here now says all notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 171.36,
          "en": "Instead of new Remix app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 171.36,
          "end": 173.103,
          "en": "which it says on other pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "We can also add metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 177.75,
          "en": "by copying this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 177.75,
          "end": 182.75,
          "en": "to keep things simple to this dynamic route here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 182.97,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "and there we of course, might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 187.32,
          "en": "to access some dynamic data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 187.32,
          "end": 190.38,
          "en": "For example, the title here should probably be the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 190.38,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "of the note that's being displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "This is again, pretty easy to do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "because like many other functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 197.67000000000002,
          "en": "the meta function automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 197.67000000000002,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "receives a data object provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 202.41,
          "en": "And that object, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 204.66,
          "en": "has a data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 204.66,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "So now this is not the overall data object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 208.89,
          "en": "but a property in that object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 208.89,
          "end": 212.85,
          "en": "that's provided by Remix, that's called data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 212.85,
          "end": 215.52,
          "en": "And this data property holds the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 215.52,
          "end": 217.82999999999998,
          "en": "that is returned by your loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 217.82999999999998,
          "end": 220.29,
          "en": "So in this case, the note which we selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 220.29,
          "end": 223.59,
          "en": "This is what we receive here on this data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 223.59,
          "end": 224.973,
          "en": "in this meta function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 225.93,
          "end": 227.49,
          "en": "And therefore here we can of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 227.49,
          "end": 229.53,
          "en": "set the title to data.title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 232.29,
          "en": "since we know that for this component, for this route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 232.29,
          "end": 234.18,
          "en": "data will simply be a note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 234.18,
          "end": 236.613,
          "en": "because that is what our loader returns here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 238.02,
          "end": 240.27,
          "en": "You could, for example, all the access params here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 240.27,
          "end": 242.82,
          "en": "if you would need access to the params themselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 242.82,
          "end": 245.313,
          "en": "But here, I'm just interested in the final data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 249.51,
          "en": "And with that I'm setting the title of a specific note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 249.51,
          "end": 251.4,
          "en": "as a page title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 251.4,
          "end": 255.42,
          "en": "And therefore if we visit one of these notes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 255.42,
          "end": 257.43,
          "en": "you will see that this page title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 257.43,
          "end": 259.23,
          "en": "is adjusted appropriately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 259.23,
          "end": 261.42,
          "en": "Here it's Remix is awesome!",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 261.42,
          "end": 264.033,
          "en": "And for the other note, it's New Notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 266.46,
          "end": 269.553,
          "en": "And that's how you can add metadata to your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
